25 %<\/strong>\n      <span class=\"mc-offer__extra\">Extra-Rabatt<\/span>\n    <\/li>\n\n    <li class=\"mc-offer__tier\">\n      <span class=\"mc-offer__quantity\">4 Artikel<\/span>\n      <strong class=\"mc-offer__discount\">30 %<\/strong>\n      <span class=\"mc-offer__extra\">Extra-Rabatt<\/span>\n    <\/li>\n\n    <li class=\"mc-offer__tier mc-offer__tier--best\">\n      <span class=\"mc-offer__quantity\">5+ Artikel<\/span>\n      <strong class=\"mc-offer__discount\">35 %<\/strong>\n      <span class=\"mc-offer__extra\">Extra-Rabatt<\/span>\n    <\/li>\n  <\/ul>\n\n  <p class=\"mc-offer__note\">\n    Der Rabatt wird automatisch an der Kasse abgezogen.\n  <\/p>\n<\/section>"}},"description":{"type":"description","settings":{}},"inventory":{"type":"inventory","settings":{"text_style":"body","inventory_threshold":10,"show_inventory_quantity":true}},"pickup_availability":{"type":"pickup_availability","settings":{}},"complementary":{"type":"complementary","settings":{"block_heading":"Pairs well with","make_collapsible_row":false,"icon":"tag","product_list_limit":4,"products_per_page":1,"image_ratio":"adapt","enable_quick_add":true}},"collapsible-row-1":{"type":"collapsible_tab","disabled":true,"settings":{"heading":"Garanzia di qualità","icon":"none","content":"<p>Per noi la qualità e la soddisfazione del cliente vengono prima di tutto. Offriamo esclusivamente prodotti della massima qualità, perché siamo convinti che voi meritiate solo il meglio. Ogni prodotto viene accuratamente selezionato e testato per garantire che soddisfi i nostri rigorosi standard.<\/p>","custom_liquid":"","page":"","default_open":false}},"collapsible-row-2":{"type":"collapsible_tab","disabled":true,"settings":{"heading":"Guida alle taglie","icon":"none","content":"<p>Per questo articolo consigliamo di ordinare una taglia in più! Non siete sicuri? Consultate la tabella delle taglie.<\/p>","custom_liquid":"","page":"","default_open":false}}},"block_order":["custom_liquid_iwjREe","title","badges","price","icon_with_text","variant_picker","buy_buttons","seowill_trust_badges_star_rating_WdH4Ni","custom_liquid_XCXhUt","custom_liquid_FQnFTH","description","inventory","pickup_availability","complementary","collapsible-row-1","collapsible-row-2"],"custom_css":[".loox-rating {margin-top: -1rem;}"],"settings":{"color_scheme":"scheme-1","enable_sticky_info":true,"media_size":"large","gallery_layout":"grid-mix","mobile_thumbnails":"show","enable_image_zoom":true,"enable_video_looping":true,"padding_top":56,"padding_bottom":100}},"related-products":{"type":"related-products","custom_css":[".f-price-item {font-size: 15px;}"],"settings":{"color_scheme":"scheme-1","heading":"&nbsp;Kombinieren und zusätzlich <strong>20 % sparen<\/strong>&nbsp;","heading_size":"h2","heading_highlight_style":"none","subheading":"","description":"","limit":6,"columns":4,"column_gap":"extra-small","row_gap":"inherit","enable_slider":true,"controls_position":"inside","pcard_image_ratio":"","columns_mobile":"2","swipe_on_mobile":true,"padding_top":40,"padding_bottom":38,"show_section_divider":false,"divider_width":"fixed","custom_class":"pricefg"}},"rich_text_GjhrBp":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"subheading_gUNRwN":{"type":"subheading","settings":{"subheading":"ÜBER MODEHAUS CLARA"}},"heading_tw8MMi":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"&nbsp;<strong>«Eleganz ist das, was in Erinnerung bleibt.»<\/strong>&nbsp;","heading_size":"hd3","heading_highlight_style":"none"}},"text_WpgxVt":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Seit 2015 steht Modehaus Clara für zeitloses Design und dezente Eleganz. Unsere Kollektionen verbinden hochwertige Verarbeitung, liebevolle Details und eine moderne Interpretation klassischer Mode – inspiriert von der Schweizer Lebensart und ihrem Sinn für Qualität und Stil.<\/p>","text_size":"text-inherit"}}},"block_order":["subheading_gUNRwN","heading_tw8MMi","text_WpgxVt"],"name":"t:sections.rich-text.presets.name","settings":{"color_scheme":"scheme-inverse","content_alignment":"center","padding_top":50,"padding_bottom":50,"show_section_divider":false,"divider_width":"fixed","custom_class":""}},"testimonials_8JHr3L":{"type":"testimonials","blocks":{"testimonial_XetKiN":{"type":"testimonial","settings":{"show_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/2fddd10c-2993-43e7-a73d-8226786df77f.png","text":"<p>«Ich bin ganz verliebt in diese Kombination. Der Pullover ist weich und kuschelig warm, das Tuch setzt einen eleganten Farbakzent und die Tasche passt perfekt dazu – praktisch und stilvoll zugleich. Die Qualität ist einwandfrei, alles sieht genauso aus wie auf den Fotos.»<\/p>","author":"Margarida S.","bio":"Verifizierter Kauf","product":"","icon":"none"}},"testimonial_dhi3Xf":{"type":"testimonial","settings":{"show_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/10586945-4e45-4896-a89e-377eebf70032.png","text":"<p>«Dieser Leinenblazer begeistert mich! Er sitzt genau richtig – weder zu eng noch zu weit. Der Stoff ist angenehm leicht für den Sommer und fühlt sich wunderbar hochwertig an. Mit Jeans kombiniert sieht er im Alltag einfach toll aus. Schon jetzt mein neues Lieblingsstück im Kleiderschrank.»<\/p>","author":"Teresa M.","bio":"Verifizierter Kauf","product":"","icon":"none"}},"testimonial_fKmgTH":{"type":"testimonial","settings":{"show_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/216747c1-1477-4afc-9183-c1cf4f69f95a.png","text":"<p>«Von der Bestellung bis zur Lieferung hat alles wunderbar geklappt. Mein Kleidungsstück war so liebevoll in Seidenpapier verpackt, dass es sich wie ein Geschenk angefühlt hat. Das Leinen ist von ausgezeichneter Qualität und der Schnitt schmeichelt der Figur. Schnelle Lieferung und rundum zufrieden.»<\/p>","author":"Helena F.","bio":"Verifizierter Kauf","product":"","icon":"none"}},"testimonial_TtpjJx":{"type":"testimonial","settings":{"show_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/cfb7f666-9406-4ddb-8fc5-6845b885d668.png","text":"<p>«Ich habe dieses Tuch einer Freundin geschenkt – und sie hat sich riesig gefreut! Die Farben sind wunderschön und der Stoff fühlt sich angenehm weich an. Die liebevolle Verpackung hat das Geschenk noch besonderer gemacht. Ich bestelle bestimmt wieder.»<\/p>","author":"Cristina R.","bio":"Verifizierter Kauf","product":"","icon":"none"}}},"block_order":["testimonial_XetKiN","testimonial_dhi3Xf","testimonial_fKmgTH","testimonial_TtpjJx"],"custom_css":[],"settings":{"color_scheme":"scheme-1","heading":"&nbsp;<strong>Das sagen unsere Kundinnen<\/strong>&nbsp;","heading_size":"h2","heading_highlight_style":"none","subheading":"4,6\/5 basierend auf 247 Bewertungen","description":"","text_size":"text-base","card_color_scheme":"","card_layout":"1","card_text_size":"text-base","columns_desktop":4,"column_gap":"medium","enable_slider":true,"columns_mobile":"1","swipe_on_mobile":true,"padding_top":38,"padding_bottom":40,"show_section_divider":false,"divider_width":"fixed","custom_class":""}},"image_with_text_NwdB6R":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"subheading_ttm4KV":{"type":"subheading","settings":{"subheading":"AVISO IMPORTANTE"}},"heading_3rFe6a":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"REEMBOLSAMOS CADA 10.º PEDIDO","heading_size":"h3","heading_highlight_style":"none"}},"text_bcdYPf":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>\"Com o coração apertado, devo comunicar-vos que a Inês e Beatriz vai encerrar as suas portas devido à minha reforma. Esta decisão não foi fácil. Deixar o trabalho de uma vida nunca é simples, mas acredito que chegou o momento. Já não consigo manter os padrões de excelência que merecem.\"<\/p><p>Como despedida e um sincero agradecimento pela vossa fidelidade ao longo dos anos, oferecemos as nossas últimas peças artesanais a preços excecionais. Além disso, reembolsaremos a totalidade do valor de <strong>cada 10.º pedido<\/strong> efetuado.<\/p><p>Garanta uma peça da história da Inês e Beatriz antes que desapareça para sempre.<\/p><p><strong>— INÊS COSTA<\/strong><br\/><br\/>Fundadora & Estilista<\/p>","text_size":"text-base"}}},"block_order":["subheading_ttm4KV","heading_3rFe6a","text_bcdYPf"],"disabled":true,"name":"t:sections.image-with-text.presets.name","settings":{"section_color_scheme":"","color_scheme":"","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/download_4.png","image_height":"large","layout":"image_first","desktop_content_position":"center","desktop_content_alignment":"center","enable_parallax":false,"parallax_direction":"vertical","mobile_content_alignment":"left","padding_top":50,"padding_bottom":50,"show_section_divider":false,"divider_width":"fixed","custom_class":""}},"17819539494c5a1946":{"type":"apps","settings":{"include_margins":true,"padding_top":0,"padding_bottom":0,"custom_class":""}},"rich_text_7rBwdd":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"heading_cUbnWW":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Because you need time for yourself. Blend beauty in you","heading_size":"h1","heading_highlight_style":"none"}}},"block_order":["heading_cUbnWW"],"disabled":true,"custom_css":[".rich-text__heading {max-width: 65rem; margin: 0 auto;}"],"settings":{"color_scheme":"","content_alignment":"center","padding_top":60,"padding_bottom":0,"show_section_divider":false,"divider_width":"fixed","custom_class":""}},"image_with_text_MgddA8":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"subheading_XLgqVJ":{"type":"subheading","settings":{"subheading":"Safety Ingredients"}},"heading_J7mctK":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"A fruit enzyme that helps exfoliate and soften skin","heading_size":"h1","heading_highlight_style":"none"}},"text_A3Dahr":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>A fruit enzyme, such as bromelain from pineapple or papain from papaya, helps exfoliate and soften skin by breaking down and dissolving dead skin cells. This gentle exfoliation process reveals a smoother, brighter complexion and promotes cell turnover. Suitable for all skin types, it offers a natural and less abrasive alternative to traditional chemical exfoliants.<\/p>","text_size":"text-base"}}},"block_order":["subhead